{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787706215251289002,"compiled_state":{"alias":"receptive-houndy-nilgai","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"158e3e80f113dd82540e998ebdde9bc7037aa4fa77c91a1557c3bf2c728efd34","event_uuid":"05cf3fe8-cbea-4c49-b66a-5e22bdf1b3bd","position":{"commit_sha":"daacd17807b5c135d1d082a977d0c099a66368a3","position":"1787706137778172001-05cf3fe8-cbea-4c49-b66a-5e22bdf1b3bd"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"f7d6143f331c52e7d91570bc63b1cb04bc81e348e2af25b470d91832f312c4a9","event_uuid":"3c584631-bd60-4cd5-881c-a5d4b0ba9e5a","position":{"commit_sha":"6c7b0bc7428c2f4391c8ab3221aeb7c632905808","position":"1787706215251289001-3c584631-bd60-4cd5-881c-a5d4b0ba9e5a"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787706137778172001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"3c584631-bd60-4cd5-881c-a5d4b0ba9e5a","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"0bd6-c3b2-d9a8-45b2"}],"description":"## Summary\n\nThe blue-green autodeploy of the `mcp` target is crash-looping on a fail-closed auth check, and\nthe box is currently serving a **hand-patched container whose fix is not in git**. The next\nsuccessful deploy will revert that patch and re-break the service.\n\n`rebar-autodeploy-errors` is IN ALARM (confirmed 2026-08-25 via `describe-alarms`, us-east-1).\n\n## Evidence\n\nVerbatim from SSM invocation `0d3b8b4b` (2026-08-25T16:37:45Z):\n\n    rebar._mcp_auth.AuthConfigError: static tokens file '/run/secrets/mcp-static-tokens.json' defines no tokens\n      File \"/app/src/rebar/mcp_server.py\", line 774, in main\n        server = build_server(cfg)\n      File \"/app/src/rebar/_mcp_auth.py\", line 725, in _load_static_tokens\n\nThis is the documented fail-closed posture at `infra/compose/docker-compose.yml:367-371`.\n\nConsequence, from invocation `448230fe`:\n\n    AUTODEPLOY_ERROR {\"reason\": \"mcp-unhealthy\", \"detail\": \"new mcp container rebar-mcp-d49466b5e960-8092 failed /health within 120s; removing it, leaving the OLD upstream live\"}\n    AUTODEPLOY_ERROR {\"reason\": \"deploy_failed\", \"detail\": \"target=d49466b5e960... fail#9 backoff=900s\"}\n\nAn operator recovered manually at 16:55Z by injecting `REBAR_MCP_AUTH_ISSUER_URL` via `env_file`\nand running `compose recreate` (invocation `d1d2ce4a` — \"HEALTHY at t=8\",\n\"Uvicorn running on http://0.0.0.0:8091\"). A live probe confirms\n`GET https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/mcp` returns `HTTP 401 invalid_token`, so it is serving.\n\n## Why this is urgent\n\n1. The running config is out-of-band. The `env_file` injection is not committed, so it is one\n   successful autodeploy away from being lost.\n2. The deployed code is stale: the box serves `d49466b5e960`, four commits behind `main` HEAD at\n   the time of investigation.\n3. `fail#9 backoff=900s` means the loop is still retrying and still failing.\n\nThis is INDEPENDENT of the missing-tickets-store defect — it explains why the deployed code is\nstale, not why `fsck` reports an uninitialized store. Neither causes the other.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] The operator's manual `REBAR_MCP_AUTH_ISSUER_URL` / static-tokens fix is captured in git so\n      a deploy reproduces it rather than reverting it.\n- [ ] The `mcp` autodeploy target reaches healthy on a current `main` build.\n- [ ] `rebar-autodeploy-errors` returns to OK.\n- [ ] A deploy that fails auth config is distinguishable in the error signal from one that fails\n      for other reasons (today both surface as `mcp-unhealthy`).","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","0bd6-c3b2-d9a8-45b2"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["infra","mcp","deploy","auth"],"ticket_id":"6af7-edb7-88ce-4110","ticket_type":"bug","title":"mcp autodeploy crash-loops on AuthConfigError and the live fix is un-versioned (rebar-autodeploy-errors in ALARM)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["05cf3fe8-cbea-4c49-b66a-5e22bdf1b3bd","3c584631-bd60-4cd5-881c-a5d4b0ba9e5a"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787706215251289002,"uuid":"1a85b196-394f-42f3-94b7-89d280d76320"}